  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3d4549ab826df384b91e9e2da5b95c50, type: 3}
  m_Name: Helper_GameStart
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::HelperPopupDefinition
  helperId: early_game_helper
  title: Welcome
  bodyText: 'Welcome {playerName}, let''s start going through the basics. Firstly,
    seeing a yellow exclamation mark signifies a quest is available. Details about
    what needs to be done are shown within the quest log.


    Interacting with
    an object such as this tree will allow you to gather logs from it. You can still
    gather items without any tools but it will be slow.


    The game world can
    be zoomed in or out by using the up and down arrow keys if you ever lose track
    of your surroundings.


    These help popups can be disabled and more can be
    adjusted in the settings.'
  activationTrigger: 1
